{"4481530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BEACONFALL", "steam_appid": 4481530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaconfall - is a dynamic strategy game about defending a settlement on an island surrounded by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures, gather resources, and assign villagers between work and defense. Every building either boosts your economy or strengthens your fortifications - but you’ll never have enough hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/418d53683936e1bca31cfa07891dab68.poster.avif?t=1785266133\" width=960 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/418d53683936e1bca31cfa07891dab68.webm?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/418d53683936e1bca31cfa07891dab68.mp4?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a wave begins, enemies emerge from the gloom and attack from multiple directions. Staff your towers, place traps, and make decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse is the heart of your settlement. It holds back the darkness - and it can become a powerful weapon if you choose to invest in its upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts around 20–30 minutes and takes place on a procedurally generated island. Different scenarios, unique island layouts, and bosses demand new strategies and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the final assault and prove your light is stronger than the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/92c5d0914f51649f632ad323430beee5.poster.avif?t=1785266133\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/92c5d0914f51649f632ad323430beee5.webm?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/92c5d0914f51649f632ad323430beee5.mp4?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and grow your settlement in real time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against enemy waves in a tower defense format </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade buildings and unlock new specializations </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a tactical pause to make smart decisions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated islands </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple scenarios with unique bosses</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaconfall - is a dynamic strategy game about defending a settlement on an island surrounded by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structures, gather resources, and assign villagers between work and defense. Every building either boosts your economy or strengthens your fortifications - but you’ll never have enough hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/418d53683936e1bca31cfa07891dab68.poster.avif?t=1785266133\" width=960 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/418d53683936e1bca31cfa07891dab68.webm?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/418d53683936e1bca31cfa07891dab68.mp4?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a wave begins, enemies emerge from the gloom and attack from multiple directions. Staff your towers, place traps, and make decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lighthouse is the heart of your settlement. It holds back the darkness - and it can become a powerful weapon if you choose to invest in its upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts around 20–30 minutes and takes place on a procedurally generated island. Different scenarios, unique island layouts, and bosses demand new strategies and builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the final assault and prove your light is stronger than the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/92c5d0914f51649f632ad323430beee5.poster.avif?t=1785266133\" width=960 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/92c5d0914f51649f632ad323430beee5.webm?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4481530/extras/92c5d0914f51649f632ad323430beee5.mp4?t=1785266133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and grow your settlement in real time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against enemy waves in a tower defense format </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade buildings and unlock new specializations </p></li><